WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — gates (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.361
<v Narrator>Ọjọ́ kẹta, kọ̀ǹpútà ko ní yẹ̀ ki o gba iṣẹ́ tí a ko lè paṣẹ̀ padà titi tí a fi ṣayẹwo pé o jẹ́ aabo.

2
00:00:08.441 --> 00:00:18.132
<v Narrator>Keji, o yẹ ki o ṣe idanwo ọna ti o dara julọ ni akọkọ ati pe o jẹ ki awoṣe AI nla kan nikan nigbati awọn irinṣẹ rọrun ba gbagbe.

3
00:00:18.212 --> 00:00:25.690
<v Narrator>Keji, gbogbo ipinnu ni a kọ si rira pẹlu agbara ti o lo, nitorinaa ẹnikẹni le ṣe atunyẹwo rẹ lẹhin.
